---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="PQRS | Avanti Logística — Peticiones, Quejas, Reclamos y Sugerencias"
  description="Envíanos tus peticiones, quejas, reclamos o sugerencias. En Avanti Logística atendemos cada solicitud con seriedad y compromiso."
>

  <section class="bg-[#001540] py-20 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <p class="text-[#C9A84C] font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Tu opinión importa</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">PQRS</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg">Peticiones, Quejas, Reclamos y Sugerencias</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6">

      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm p-8 md:p-10">
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-8 text-center">
          Completa el formulario y nos comunicaremos contigo en un plazo máximo de <strong>3 días hábiles</strong>. También puedes escribirnos directamente por WhatsApp o correo.
        </p>

        <form
          action="https://formsubmit.co/gerencia@avantilogistica.com"
          method="POST"
          class="space-y-5"
        >
          <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Nuevo PQRS - Avanti Logística" />
          <input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="false" />
          <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="https://avantilogistica.com/gracias" />

          <div>
            <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1" for="nombre">Nombre completo *</label>
            <input
              type="text" id="nombre" name="nombre"
              class="w-full px-4 py-2.5 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#002366] text-sm"
              placeholder="Tu nombre" required
            />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1" for="email">Correo electrónico *</label>
            <input
              type="email" id="email" name="email"
              class="w-full px-4 py-2.5 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#002366] text-sm"
              placeholder="tucorreo@ejemplo.com" required
            />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1" for="telefono">Teléfono / WhatsApp</label>
            <input
              type="tel" id="telefono" name="telefono"
              class="w-full px-4 py-2.5 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#002366] text-sm"
              placeholder="+57 300 000 0000"
            />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1" for="tipo">Tipo de solicitud *</label>
            <select
              id="tipo" name="tipo"
              class="w-full px-4 py-2.5 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#002366] text-sm bg-white" required
            >
              <option value="">Selecciona una opción</option>
              <option value="peticion">Petición</option>
              <option value="queja">Queja</option>
              <option value="reclamo">Reclamo</option>
              <option value="sugerencia">Sugerencia</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1" for="mensaje">Mensaje *</label>
            <textarea
              id="mensaje" name="mensaje" rows="5"
              class="w-full px-4 py-2.5 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#002366] text-sm resize-none"
              placeholder="Describe tu solicitud con el mayor detalle posible..." required
            ></textarea>
          </div>

          <button
            type="submit"
            class="w-full bg-[#002366] hover:bg-[#003087] text-white font-semibold py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors shadow"
          >
            Enviar solicitud
          </button>
        </form>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-100 text-center space-y-3">
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">¿Prefieres contactarnos directamente?</p>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center">
            <a
              href="https://wa.me/573015006672?text=Tengo%20una%20PQRS%20para%20Avanti%20Logística"
              target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-green-500 hover:bg-green-600 text-white text-sm font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg transition-colors"
            >
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-white" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z"/></svg>
              WhatsApp
            </a>
            <a
              href="mailto:gerencia@avantilogistica.com"
              class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-gray-200 hover:border-[#002366] text-gray-700 hover:text-[#002366] text-sm font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg transition-colors"
            >
              Correo electrónico
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
